            <note corresp="#d148-f1" n="14" xml:id="d148-f1-content">
                <p>Signed at London, June 28, 1929. For text, see 46 Stat. 2523, or League of
                    Nations Treaty Series, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">cii</hi>, p. 245.</p>
            </note>
